> cap0(x: u32 in 0..4194303) = x*x
> range cap0
range of cap0 -> u32:
  0..4294966857
  fits in u32
  over all 4194304 points of the domain
> equiv cap0 ~ x*x
cap0 and x*x are equal on the domain of cap0 (exhaustive)
> cap1(x: u32 in 0..4194304) = x*x
> range cap1
range of cap1 -> u32:
  0..4294868313
  fits in u32
  sampled 65536 points (domain has 4194305 points); not exhaustive
  sound bound (intervals): 0..4294967295
> equiv cap1 ~ x*x
cap1 and x*x are equal on the domain of cap1 (sampled, not proved; no SAT proof: a float or real value)
